fore initiation.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"丙磺舒 interacts broadly with antibiotics, including cephalosporins and penicillins\",\n            \"explanation\": \"丙磺舒 enhances systemic exposure to multiple antibiotics by inhibiting their renal clearance. It interacts with 头孢来星 and the broader 头孢菌素族抗菌素 class, historically used to potentiate their effects [Data: Relationships (27240, 27243)]. Similarly, though not directly listed as interacting with 青霉素类抗菌药物 in the provided relationships, its role in elevating penicillin concentrations is referenced indirectly via its mechanism as a renal secretion inhibitor commonly paired with penicillins [Data: Relationships (27243)]. These interactions demonstrate 丙磺舒’s utility in antimicrobial therapy augmentation, though this practice has diminished with the availability of more potent antibiotics.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"丙磺舒 influences diagnostic accuracy through interaction with diagnostic agents\",\n            \"explanation\": \"丙磺舒 can interfere with diagnostic procedures by inhibiting the renal excretion of diagnostic dyes such as 碘吡啦啥 and phenolsulfonphthalein, potentially leading to inaccurate test results [Data: Relationships (27269)]. By reducing the clearance of these agents, 丙磺舒 may cause artificially elevated retention or delayed excretion, compromising the reliability of renal function or imaging studies. Clinicians must consider withholding 丙磺舒 prior to such diagnostic evaluations to avoid confounding outcomes.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Emerging evidence links 丙磺舒 to modulation of natural compound bioavailability\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Recent research shows that 丙磺舒 enhances cellular uptake of dietary polyphenols like 白藜芦醇苷 by inhibiting MRP2-mediated efflux [Data: Relationships (27267)]. In experimental models, co-administration with 丙磺舒 increased 白藜芦醇苷 intracellular concentrations by 1.6-fold, suggesting potential applicat